<title>USA: Sinoamerican IPO postponed -- underwriter.</title>
<headline>Sinoamerican IPO postponed -- underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The planned initial public offering in Sinoamerican Telecom Inc was postponed due to market conditions, lead underwriter Southcoast Capital Corp said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The initial public offering proposed three million shares at an estimated price range of $11 to $13 under the ticker symbol &quot;SIO&quot; on the American Stock Exchange. The initial public offering was expected to trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>Sinoamerican Telecom deals with telecommunications in Taiwan.</p>
</text>
